					"content": "没有回应…我还以为魈无论在哪都会赶过来呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10280505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10280505,
					"content": "难道说，就连魈都感觉不到我们的气息吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10280506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
