					"content": "（……）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10280507
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10280507,
					"content": "（如果真是如此，将意味着什么？我们身处的这片地下…究竟是怎么回事？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
